    "file": "libredwg/src/dwg.spec",
    "description": "Null-pointer dereference in JSON writer for DIMENSION_RADIUS: the generated serializer unconditionally accesses DIMENSION common fields (from COMMON_ENTITY_DIMENSION / handle data path) for obj->tio.entity without validating that the typed entity payload is present. With malformed fuzzed DWG input, an object is typed as DIMENSION_RADIUS but its internal entity pointer/state is missing, so dwg_json_DIMENSION_RADIUS reads through a NULL base (ASan read at 0x28).",
    "conditions": "Harness llvmfuzz parses attacker-controlled bytes into a Dwg_Data, then randomly selects output mode; when mode 3 calls dwg_write_json, json_objects_write dispatches to dwg_json_object and then dwg_json_DIMENSION_RADIUS for a crafted DIMENSION_RADIUS object. Trigger requires inconsistent/corrupt object state from parsing (type indicates DIMENSION_RADIUS but required entity sub-structure/fields are NULL), and JSON export path lacking defensive NULL/state checks before field emission."
  },
